  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KG3zJMU.png\" width=\"1128\" height=\"1904\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MBQksdy.png\" alt=\"生命與死亡更新\" width=\"1864\" height=\"2693\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>隨著考古主題在 Minecraft 1.20「Trails & Tales」更新中登場，不難發現 Mojang 在這龐大的考古世界中，恐怕僅邁出了小小的一步。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>本模組旨在改進該更新所引入的機制，並在忠於遊戲原有風格的同時，為我的世界增添更多值得探索的新事物，進一步擴充我的世界宇宙。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>我們也計畫定期將此模組更新至最新版本，並於接下來的數週內推出新內容。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2IiWwGYwBPU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>相容性：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>世界生成</strong> - BA 包含通用的 (c:) 生物群系標籤，以及以下模組的標籤：</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Terralith</span></a><span style=\"color:#008000\">、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-vibrant-journeys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project: Vibrant Journeys</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ecosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">William Wythers' Expannded Ecosphere</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong>其他</strong> - 其他雜項相容性包括：</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\"><a style=\"color:#008000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElytraSlot</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cristel-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cristel Lib</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">若您發現缺少特定相容性，或在安裝模組後難以尋獲任何結構，請<a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/BetterArcheology/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交 Issue</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d60c79dc-ea5e-4e57-b18e-11518bc241e7.webp\" alt=\"使用代碼 Pandarix 於 Bisecthosting.com 可享 25% 折扣\" width=\"1092\" height=\"182\"></strong></p>",
